# ─── Secrets. Never commit. ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This project holds bKash merchant credentials, JWT signing secrets,
# Groq API keys, and database credentials. A leak here is unrecoverable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Scratch file ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Holds real error output, which contains tokens, connection strings,
# and user data. Never commit it, never paste it into a PR.
context/current-issues.md

# ─── Setup kit ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vendored copy of the spec-kit setup skill. Tooling, not application code.
spec-kit/

# ─── Reference material ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-party notes and transcripts kept locally for reference. Not ours to
# republish, and this repository is public.
MERN Stack Like Senior Depeloper Using AI.txt

